  "articleBodyHtml": "<h2>Merchandise and Set Completion</h2>\n<p>The speaker discusses the possibility of combining merchandise items to create a complete set. They mention that while some items like &#x27;Promise advent&#x27; may not be necessary, they are still available for purchase. Fans have the option to keep the items together or separate them based on their preferences.</p>\n<h2>Personal Enjoyment and Privacy</h2>\n<p>The speaker emphasizes that their current project is for personal enjoyment and will remain private. They express excitement about keeping all the necessary items for themselves without sharing them with others.</p>\n<h2>Nostalgic Content and Event Planning</h2>\n<p>The channel will feature nostalgic songs, and there are plans for various events, including a &#x27;Doggy of the Day&#x27; promotion and a Fulamoku party. The event will also include a Totsubachi Main Café call as part of the summer bingo.</p>\n<h2>Event Timing and Coordination</h2>\n<p>The event is scheduled to start very early at 6AM P.E. and will continue with multiple activities, including a rockin&#x27; party mini and a Fulamoku rockin&#x27; party. The timing of the event is also noted in relation to other channels, with MPT being one hour later than their channel and three hours earlier than A Fumiko Morning.</p>\n<h2>Collaborations and 3D Debut</h2>\n<p>The event will include a 3D debut collab, which some people may have missed. The theme of the event is Hololive ONLY, and they will be singing Hololive songs, including some senpai songs. Additionally, they will be doing an old collab described as very scary.</p>\n<h2>Visual Novel and Game Play</h2>\n<p>They have their own visual novel and will be playing Arkham. The event will also include a segment where they start from the beginning again, with Hachima-senpai playing for the first time.</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_AO1pLt3pU4</p>",
